Z||000007||GT-maniac||05-03-2001||03:23 AM||||That black GT looks identical to my 85 GT, They're long lost twins ! Except mine's a canadian model. I also have just picked up another fiero. A fully loaded 87 GT for 800.<BR>It's in rough shape unfortunately but I'll get her fixed up. At least it runs unlike my poor old 85 which is sitting in my garage waiting for an engine transplant in two weeks. I can hardly wait..<BR>I'd get more if I could find some place to put em all, my wife is already complaining that we have too many cars :^) I tried to explain to her that they're not just cars they're fieros but I don't think she really believes me. Have fun with your new babies. ||||reg||1
